---
title: Talks
description: Keynotes, invited talks, panels and podcasts by Bishesh Khanal — international first.
---
{%- set tiers = [
  { key: "international", label: "International", note: "Keynotes and invited talks abroad and at global venues", style: "grid" },
  { key: "regional", label: "Regional · South Asia", note: "India and the region", style: "grid" },
  { key: "national", label: "National", note: "Government, national conferences and institutions across Nepal", style: "compact" },
  { key: "local", label: "Local", note: "Colleges, schools, hospitals and meetups", style: "list" }
] -%}
<section class="page-hero container">
  <div class="eyebrow">Talks</div>
  <h1>Talks &amp; conversations</h1>
  <p class="lead">{{ talks | count }} talks since 2016, on AI in health, AI centres of excellence for the Global South, and how work is being reorganized. The dot shows which persona a talk speaks to.</p>
</section>
<section class="container" data-filters="talks">
  <div class="chips">
    <button class="chip" data-key="personaF" data-value="*" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
    {%- for p in ["dreamer", "scientist", "entrepreneur"] %}
    <button class="chip" data-key="personaF" data-value="{{ p }}" aria-pressed="false"><i class="dot {{ p }}"></i>{{ p | capitalize }} <span class="n">{{ talks | where("persona", p) | count }}</span></button>
    {%- endfor %}
    <span style="width:1rem"></span>
    {%- for k in ["keynote", "invited-talk", "panel", "podcast", "interview", "tv"] %}{% set n = talks | where("kind", k) | count %}{% if n %}
    <button class="chip" data-key="kind" data-value="{{ k }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ k | replace("-", " ") | capitalize }} <span class="n">{{ n }}</span></button>
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<div class="container">
{%- for tier in tiers %}{% set items = talks | where("scope", tier.key) | featuredFirst %}{% if items | count %}
  <section class="tier" data-filter-group="talks">
    <div class="tier-head"><h2>{{ tier.label }}</h2><span class="meta">{{ tier.note }} · {{ items | count }}</span></div>
    {%- if tier.style == "list" %}
    <ul class="rows">
      {%- for t in items %}
      <li class="row" data-filterable="talks" data-persona-f="{{ t.persona }}" data-kind="{{ t.kind }}"><span class="d">{{ t.date | fuzzyDate }}</span><span><i class="dot {{ t.persona }}"></i><span class="t">{% if t.url or t.video %}<a href="{{ t.url or t.video }}">{{ t.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ t.title }}{% endif %}</span> <span class="v">— {{ t.venue }}</span></span></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- else %}
    <div class="talk-grid{% if tier.style == 'compact' %} compact{% endif %}">
      {%- for t in items %}{% include "partials/talk-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </section>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>
